## This event is generated each time file analysis generates a content
## similarity value for the file contents.
##
## f: The file.
##
## alg: The content similarity algorithm identifier.
##
## content_sim: The content similarity value.
##
## .. zeek:see:: Files::add_analyzer Files::ANALYZER_CONTENT_SIM
event file_content_sim%(f: fa_file, alg: string, content_sim: string%);
